From 55422a19067049f637eb0a4066ea0bf31c68dd77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 23:57:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/51] begonia-wifi (fwport): shim round 1 - ioremap,
 cmb_stub, adapter exports

- compat/include/mtk-bsp-compat.h: ioremap_nocache->ioremap macro;
  no-op KERNEL_clk_buf_ctrl / KERNEL_pmic_ldo_vcn{18,33_2}_lp (adapter
  header leaves these undefined on mainline - gated on CONFIG_MACH_*).
- compat/include/mtk_wcn_cmb_stub.h: real vendor cmb_stub header (enums +
  protos) so wmt_plat.h/wmt_plat_alps.c resolve CMB_STUB_AIF_*.
- common/mtk-bsp-compat.c: no-op bodies for the connectivity_export_*
  wrappers the adapter header maps unconditionally (pmic_set_register_value,
  mt6306 gpio, show_stack, dump_thread_state, dump_gpio_info) - avoids the
  redefine war and the dangling link symbols without pulling the connadp
  module (which drags private scheduler headers + heavy BSP).
- common/common_detect/mtk_wcn_stub_alps.o added (provides mtk_wcn_cmb_stub_*).
- compat/include: clkbuf/upmu/pmic selector-token stubs.

No register address/value/bitfield altered.

Signed-off-by: Michal Andrzejczak <mit.mis@gmail.com>
---
 .../mediatek/connectivity/common/Makefile     |   5 +
 .../connectivity/common/mtk-bsp-compat.c      |  50 +++++
 .../compat/include/mtk-bsp-compat.h           |  46 +++-
 .../compat/include/mtk_clkbuf_ctl.h           |   7 +-
 .../compat/include/mtk_pmic_api_buck.h        |  18 +-
 .../compat/include/mtk_wcn_cmb_stub.h         | 206 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../compat/include/pmic_api_buck.h            |   3 +-
 .../connectivity/compat/include/upmu_common.h |   8 +-
 8 files changed, 331 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/misc/mediatek/connectivity/common/mtk-bsp-compat.c

